Sim native Metal execution package notices

Sim source and the checked Metal tensor kernel source are covered by the
repository license. The packaged tensor_ops.metallib is generated from
crates/comfy_backend_metal/kernels/tensor_ops.metal with the locally installed,
reviewed Xcode toolchain during development-time packaging.

Apple Metal, Foundation, MetalPerformanceShaders, and
MetalPerformanceShadersGraph frameworks and SDK headers are Apple system
components. They are not copied, bundled, or redistributed by this package.

The package command performs deterministic structural assembly only. It does
not sign, certify, authorize, or grant production availability to the package.
